#: khc_view.cc:137
msgid ""
"KDE is a powerful graphical desktop environment for Unix workstations. A\n"
"KDE desktop combines ease of use, contemporary functionality and "
"outstanding\n"
"graphical design with the technological superiority of the Unix operating\n"
"system."
msgstr ""
"KDE estas potenca grafika uzinterfaco por Uniksaj operaciumoj.\n"
"KDE-tabularo kombinas facilan uzadon, ampleksan funkciaron kaj\n"
"elstaran grafikan desegnon kun la teknologia supereco de la uniksa "
"operaciumo."

